Unofficial: not made or endorsed by Edge0. The model is downloaded from
Hugging Face at run time and is not part of this plugin.

fastgen.py drives the modules of audio8_tts by Edge0 (Apache License 2.0,
https://huggingface.co/Edge0/Audio8-TTS-Realistic-Air, revision
23c305cc013fde378edb459f538317043c993a74) at run time. Its decode loop is
modelled on that model's generate() so that it decodes identically; any
portions that follow that code are used under the Apache License 2.0.
The audio8_tts NOTICE reads:

    audio8_tts

    The model architecture is inspired by the DualAR design used in Fish
    Audio S2 Pro.

The sampling (top-k and nucleus filtering, Gumbel-max sampling, and
repetition-aware sampling from VALL-E 2) was written independently from
the published methods.

The built-in voice voices/sapphire.wav was generated with Kokoro-82M
(https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, voice af_heart), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The clip is synthetic speech, not a
recording of any person.
